### I.3 HMP Permutation Calibration

```python
def hmp(pvals):
    return len(pvals) / np.sum(1.0 / pvals)

def calibrated_hmp(pvals, B=10000):
    obs = hmp(pvals)
    null = []
    for _ in range(B):
        perm = np.random.permutation(pvals)
        null.append(hmp(perm))
    return (1 + np.sum(np.array(null) <= obs)) / (B + 1)
```

