  │   For related individuals:                                              │
  │                                                                         │
  │       y = Xβ + g + ε                                                    │
  │                                                                         │
  │       g ~ N(0, σ²_g K)                                                  │
  │                                                                         │
  │   where K incorporates both:                                            │
  │       1. Genetic relatedness                                            │
  │       2. Local ancestry similarity                                      │
