  │   │  Var(Î) = 0.5·0.5 = 0.25                                        │   │
  │   │  Bias factor = 0.225/0.25 = 0.90  →  10% attenuation            │   │
  │   │                                                                 │   │
  │   │  se = 0.90, sp = 0.90, p = 0.5                                  │   │
  │   │  Bias factor = 0.20/0.25 = 0.80  →  20% attenuation             │   │
